        <item>
            <title>6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 12:42:06 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>848</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.1</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>GPT Image 2.6 Sunburst and Flare.</b> OpenAI's new image models: Sunburst for precise edits, Flare for fast everyday images. A new detail control sets how finely the image is worked out, at no extra cost.</li>
<li><b>Topaz Wonder 4.</b> The newest generative image upscaler from Topaz.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:12px 0 4px">Improvements</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li>Paul builds larger 3D sets in stages and sees photos you attach right away.</li>
<li>Connecting your phone as a camera is more reliable, also over the cable.</li>
<li>The feedback link now opens our Discord community directly.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
